  "question": {
    "text": "An object is placed at a distance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> in front of a plane mirror. The virtual and erect image is formed by the mirror. Now the mirror is moved by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> towards the stationary object. The distance by which the position of image would be shifted, will be",
    "image": null
  },
